# RESETIUS | Hiwaymed-x { ; William McWorter
# RESETIUS |   Angle 4
# RESETIUS |   Axiom s
# RESETIUS |   F=
# RESETIUS |   s=Fs+F-t
# RESETIUS |   t=+F-u+F-t
# RESETIUS |   u=++F--v++F--w
# RESETIUS |   v=++F--v-F+x
# RESETIUS |   w=-F+y++F--w
# RESETIUS |   x=-F+y-F+x
# RESETIUS |   y=FsFz
# RESETIUS |   z=+F-uFz
# RESETIUS |   }
